	"title"		"Ninja - Bleed / Fire Ninjutsu / Stealth Character Mod"
	"description"		"Adds Ninja as a playable character to Slay the Spire 2. Built on BaseLib.\n\nCharacter:\n- 72 max HP, 3 energy per turn\n- Starting relic: Hidden Blade, which adds a Kunai to your hand each turn\n- Starting deck: 4x Ninja Strike, 4x Ninja Defend, 1x Shuriken, 1x Assassination\n\nCard pool:\n- 60+ cards across multiple rarities\n- Bleed pressure with Kunai, Shuriken, and multi-hit attacks\n- Fire Ninjutsu cards using Burning and Ignite-style burst turns\n- Earth Ninjutsu cards using Resist and defensive conversion\n- Stealth and Silence cards for attack avoidance and setup turns\n- Musashi sub-archetype with Enmei healing support\n\nCustom mechanics:\n- Bleed: extra HP loss when taking unblocked attack damage\n- Burning: delayed damage that can be ignited for burst damage\n- Resist: flat per-hit damage reduction before Block\n- Stealth: enemies cannot attack you; attacking normally breaks it\n- Silence: playing the card does not break Stealth\n- Burning Infusion: attacks apply extra Burning\n- Quenching: attacks this turn apply Burning\n- Flame Shield: counter with Burning when hit\n- Shadow Clone: duplicate card plays with damage reduction\n- Enmei: heal when playing Musashi cards\n- Afterimage: generate temporary low-cost attack copies\n\nRequires BaseLib 3.3.2+.\n\nGitHub: https://github.com/RunminG/SlaytheSpire2_mod"
	"changenote"		"V1.3.2 - Current public release. Includes updated NinjaMod package, card/power assets, and balance data."
}
